 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "The MMBT3906 is a general-purpose PNP bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, the PNP partner of the MMBT3904. It withstands -40 V collector to base and collector to emitter, carries -0.2 A of collector current and may dissipate 200 mW at 25 °C ambient. DC gain is 100 to 300 at -10 mA and -1 V; parts are classified into hFE ranks L (100-200) and H (200-300), and the transition frequency is at least 300 MHz.",
